CLAUDE.local.md
# Built on each instance by datasets/<name>/build.sh, never committed.
datasets/*/*.parquet
datasets/*/*.glb
datasets/*/*.tif
# 3D Tiles a build writes in a folder of its own (datasets/<name>/<folder>/).
datasets/*/*/*.pnts
datasets/*/*/tileset.json
# CityJSON a build writes for the City Model layer (datasets/<name>/cityjson/).
datasets/*/cityjson/
# The Mapbox base map style, with its token (datasets/mapbox-basemap/build.sh).
datasets/mapbox-basemap/style/
